&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Upon police arrival, they found the victim, who was&amp;nbsp;subsequently&amp;nbsp;transported to Salem Hospital to have her injuries treated. Myers had fled the scene in his vehicle, and his current whereabouts are unknown.&amp;nbsp;Meyers is driving a silver Honda Civic with Oregon license plate 241NGP.&amp;nbsp;There is probable cause to arrest Myers for Attempted Murder in the Second Degree and other felony crimes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
