&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Salem Police&amp;nbsp;Violent Crimes Unit Detectives&amp;nbsp;are asking anyone with information on Myers&rsquo; whereabouts to call the Salem Police Tips Line, (503) 588-8477, and reference case number SMP26012142.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
