     &lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.oregon.gov/oha/PH/PREVENTIONWELLNESS/SUBSTANCEUSE/OPIOIDS/Documents/CountyServiceSummary.pdf" style="text-decoration-line: none;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(17, 85, 204); font-size:12pt"&gt;Overdose-Related Services &amp;amp; Projects Summary by Oregon County: Syringe Service Programs (SSPs) Breakdown by County&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size:12pt"&gt; (Pages 6-7, Updated April 2025 | OHA)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;
     &lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.statnews.com/2026/02/10/needle-exchanges-protected-by-ada-federal-legal-settlement/" style="text-decoration-line: none;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(17, 85, 204); font-size:12pt"&gt;STAT News: Landmark settlement could create new protections for harm reduction under disability law&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size:12pt"&gt; (Feb. 10, 2026)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
