&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;About Portland General Electric Company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
