&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/james-howard-in-concert-tickets-1981252636971?aff=oddtdtcreator" style="text-decoration-line: none;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;James Howard In Concert&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

