&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Responding officers&amp;nbsp;located&amp;nbsp;a crime scene and&amp;nbsp;identified&amp;nbsp;two juvenile victims. One victim sustained a gunshot wound to his arm after being approached during a confrontation in the park. The suspects fled the area before officers arrived.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
