&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Anyone with information is urged to contact the Salem Police Department tip line at (503) 588-8477 and reference case number&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SMP26014094&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;. Your&amp;nbsp;assistance&amp;nbsp;is crucial in helping us ensure the safety of our community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
