&lt;p&gt;The City of Battle Ground invites residents and visitors to join us for a new event, the Busy Bee Craft Fair, on Saturday, March 21, 2026, from 10:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. &amp;nbsp;This free, family-friendly event will bring together local crafters and artisans offering a wide variety of handmade goods, unique gifts, home-grown products, and delicious treats.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Busy Bee Craft Fair is a great opportunity to support small businesses, discover one-of-a-kind artisan work, and enjoy a fun day out in the community. From handcrafted d&eacute;cor and specialty foods to creative artwork and custom gifts, attendees will find something for everyone.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&ldquo;We&rsquo;re excited to welcome the community to this special event celebrating local makers and creators,&rdquo; said Joanna Martin, Recreation &amp;amp; Facilities Manager.&amp;nbsp; &ldquo;Whether you&rsquo;re doing some early spring shopping or just looking to spend a delightful day with family and friends, the Busy Bee Craft Fair offers something for all ages.&rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The event will feature 45 local crafters and artisans showcasing their unique handcrafted products.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

