&lt;p&gt;For more information, please contact 360-247-5800 and leave a message or email &lt;a href="mailto:museumnch88@gmail.com"&gt;museumnch88@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Check out the website at &lt;strong&gt;northclarkhistoricalmuseum.com.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

