&lt;p&gt;###&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The North Clark Historical Museum was founded in 1988 and is a 501(C)3 non-profit organization governed by a Board of Directors. The doors were opened in June of 2000. Mission Statement:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;To preserve North Clark County&rsquo;s natural and cultural history through collections and exhibits, and to sponsor educational programs and research opportunities for the enrichment of the public. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
